Verify that the complete extractable-field configuration is correctly persisted and restored.

Inspect:

- Template database model.
- Template API payloads.
- Frontend save logic.
- Frontend load logic.
- Serialization/deserialization.
- Placeholder configuration.
- Extractable-field metadata.
- Auto-map metadata.
- Visibility metadata.
- Control type metadata.

The following information must survive:

```text
Source field
Target field
Extraction configuration
Auto-map configuration
Transformation configuration
Control type
Visibility configuration
```

If the Admin Dashboard displays a configuration correctly before saving but the runtime loses part of it after reload, fix the persistence/serialization issue rather than patching the runtime.

