# 10. Remove the unwanted Auto-map / Auto-fill labels

Currently fields that have automatic mapping/filling applied display labels such as:

```text
Auto-maps: ...
```

and:

```text
Auto-fill: ...
```

above the field.

**Remove these labels from the normal agent-facing template UI.**

The automatic behavior should remain functional, but these implementation/configuration labels should not be exposed above the field.

For example, instead of:

```text
Auto-maps: Transaction Number
Auto-fill: Transaction Number

Transaction Number
[ MP260831... ]
```

the agent should simply see the appropriate normal field UI:

```text
Transaction Number
[ MP260831... ]
```

The Admin Dashboard may continue showing configuration information where appropriate because administrators need to understand how the template is configured.

The requirement is specifically to remove these technical/configuration labels from the **normal runtime/template experience**.

Do not remove the underlying configuration.

---

# 11. Important: Do not break ordinary fields

The fix must not affect fields that:

- Are manually entered.
- Have no auto-map.
- Have no extraction source.
- Are always visible.
- Are conditionally visible.
- Use ordinary text controls.
- Use existing date/time controls without extraction.

Test these separately.

